  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just Because**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2001-02-24.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 8 songs; 46 min [1]. Said about its sound: The tape copy has more hiss than the CD-R transfer but sounds clearer, so it was edited and lightly hiss-reduced [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2001-02-24.aud.flac16**: taped by ADL; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD Tape > Tape [1]. Also: Taper recorded with a Sony walkman and microphone in early 2001; the master tape was transferred to WAV, then FLAC level 8; Uploader obtained both a CD-R copy from the mastertape and a first-generation tape copy; he chose to transfer the tape [1]",
